6c. Guardrail mutation testing, re-run post-merge
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Re-run because the merge rewrote the very lines section 3 mutated:
step_agent.py's override now reads steps.provider_override_eligible() out of
domain/py/steps.py. Each of the four behaviours was broken again and the
matching test observed to fail. Raw failure output:

